{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":103357,\"title\":\"Unfinished Love Circle\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A young and Idealist journalist Ozan loses his life in an unfortunate traffic accident. But not everything is finished for him just yet. He gets a second chance in life. He’ll come back to life and find answers to the question marks he left behind his mysterious death. But he will not be in his own body. When Ozan uses his chance to come back to life, he’ll find himself in Kadir’s body. Meanwhile Ozan’s girlfriend Elif who is also a journalist will already be after the people who took Ozan’s life. The two lovers who have crossed paths again will have a stranger’s body between them. Kadir. In Kadir’s body, Ozan, tries to unveil the mystery of his death together with Elif. Not only does he suffer facing the woman he loves in a different body, but also encounters with Kadir’s past. Not just adapting to a new body, adapting to a whole new life will not come easy for Ozan.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gybvx6JIs8ibk87IkY2sXet8hsG.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zkZuoXWOaM1I82DTRY2uX9YTfKO.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":18,\"year\":2020,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[\"Ethem Özışık\"],\"networks\":[\"BluTV\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"TR\",\"name\":\"Turkey\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2020-10-29\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1736560,\"name\":\"Umur Turagay\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ot2SzileNggmKeqE452aAlsEVwH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1584273,\"name\":\"Dilan Çiçek Deniz\",\"character\":\"Elif Urazoğlu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sU0tfINStjBdxztByqasbkJxxfb.jpg\"},{\"id\":1577490,\"name\":\"Burak Deniz\",\"character\":\"Mehmet Kadir Bilmez\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mKrCdU2slmRR3FiiSfk9uzp99AA.jpg\"},{\"id\":145423,\"name\":\"Cem Davran\",\"character\":\"Nejat Boyluca\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fI8IWnLxdtj06SP1QjfVLT1mRQx.jpg\"},{\"id\":59758,\"name\":\"Ezel Akay\",\"character\":\"İsmet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6XqWUfOyCubEWb57IPDdDqpamqJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":2780026,\"name\":\"Gizem Ünsal\",\"character\":\"Ece\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rfizbc2sKf6gQnuGCcuYYqG7gZK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1578931,\"name\":\"Nazlı Bulum\",\"character\":\"Ebru Nişçi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zdF9S5YNNM1BFM5R4euwsLxBg3n.jpg\"},{\"id\":1941031,\"name\":\"Cihat Süvarioğlu\",\"character\":\"Mehmet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k5KNW0qeMEY1oP8g9WR2zS6lnlU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1584427,\"name\":\"Esra Ruşan\",\"character\":\"Saadet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kF9H4iMNorNRyoUdC5V9zbtiuHN.jpg\"},{\"id\":2780031,\"name\":\"Zeynep Naz Kasap\",\"character\":\"Ada\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pGxdG17alVqEpvf2ojqQXkOVe1N.jpg\"},{\"id\":2342438,\"name\":\"Başak Gümülcinelioğlu\",\"character\":\"Çağla\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rWU4boVXkQTzTTYhUybAp6qCOj8.jpg\"},{\"id\":3461507,\"name\":\"Onur Gürçay\",\"character\":\"İhsan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iIujHetUZBBeGX04eu1RcBis1b9.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"StwBzvuV-XE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"YvNLKATK06w\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"HlTDy5VnFFk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Ozan, a young and idealistic journalist, dies in an unfortunate traffic accident. But everything is not over for Ozan. He has a second chance. He will come back to life and solve the mystery behind his death.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pXE3qY7DyVZavGIAcCfXlUTi64d.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-09-10\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Journalist Ozan dies unexpectedly in a traffic accident while pursuing a mysterious news. The next morning, he comes back to life in the body of a police officer named Kadir. After learning why he was given a second chance, Ozan takes action to find his girlfriend Elif. However, when Ozan realized Kadir has a very different life from his own life, the strange situation he is in will become even more complicated.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rg1G4qD0LIQP8IJdb3wwPZgMOSg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-10\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Ozan has now begun to live as Kadir in his new body. To find out who killed him, Ozan will try to fix the life of Kadir first. However, it will not be easy for Ozan to settle things in the body of Kadir, who has a terrible life and a lot of debts. Elif's desire to take over the news that Ozan is after in order to find Ozan's murderer, complicates things in the newspaper. In order to find the murderer of Ozan, Elif will seek help from Kadir, whom she does not know is Ozan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4DOvCi8rNm2reMv6J5mIAHfzQZb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-17\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Despite being kidnapped by masked men, Elif does not stop investigating the news that Ozan was after. Elif and Kadir will encounter unexpected events in the town where they went to investigate the clue they found about the news that Ozan was after. On the one hand, Kadir tries to protect Elif while trying to stall Ismet.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cmEtGdOgZPNYlzcCcUrsmuKeuK7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-24\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jj7LZjA2TFLLUHg8UjFkREXeC6R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-01\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9xq7N62rBaEL2X0dWmzHoCn7PBo.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-08\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Things get complicated for Kadir, who learns the relationship between Nevzat and İsmet. İsmet's men find Ebru covered in blood in the bathroom. Elif is thoroughly suspicious of Kadir's behavior.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dEoc1V8efsj1bdiKiDDRtn3Mdu3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vpwhlBhgtIuVZCAaI5Kx5dEWICI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ur8ePvRIgfzSQzB75Qa8kfwaD2g.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-29\",\"runtime\":51}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-09-10\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}